  "body": "**Link to problem area**:  https://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/server-server-api/#get_matrixkeyv2queryservername and https://spec.matrix.org/v1.6/server-server-api/#get_matrixkeyv2queryservername\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\nThe response is described as an object containing one field: \r\n\r\nName | Type | Description\r\n-- | -- | --\r\nserver_keys | **Server Keys** | The queried server’s keys, signed by the notary server.\r\n\r\nThis suggests that `server_keys` maps to a JSON object (which is defined further down).\r\nHowever, the example (and `curl -X GET matrix.org/_matrix/key/v2/query/matrix.org | jq`) show that `server_keys` maps to a **list** of JSON objects.\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour**\r\nThis should says  `[Server Keys]` or similar.",
